{
    "title": "Car Key Smart Remote Connect",
    "description": "The next step in smart car control has arrived. Digital Car Key Connect uses cutting-edge technology to instantly transform your smartphone into a virtual smart car key - giving you remote lock/unlock, live diagnostics, and sharing access from anywhere.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Wirelessly LOCK and UNLOCK your doors from anywhere. No hardware required - just your phone. Forget your keys in the car? Remote unlock will save the day.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Monitor your car's status EVEN BEFORE you get in. Live diagnostics show tire pressure, battery/oil levels, and alert you to any potential issues, keeping your drive worry-free.\r\n\r\n\u2022 EASILY SHARE your digital car key with family, renters, and friends - securely and at the push of a button. No more swapping physical key fobs.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Use integrated SMART NAVIGATION to remotely locate your parked car or find the fastest route to garages and gas/charging stations.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Compatible with OVER 20 MAJOR CAR BRANDS including Audi, BMW, Buick, Cadillac, Chevrolet, Chrysler, Dodge, Ford, GMC, Hyundai, Jaguar, Jeep, Land Rover, Lexus, Lincoln, Nissan, RAM, Tesla, Toyota, Volkswagen.\r\n\r\nWith Car Key Connect: My Car Remote, total smart car control is now in the palm of your hand. Download our app today and say goodbye to physical keys forever!",
    "descriptionHTML": "The next step in smart car control has arrived. Digital Car Key Connect uses cutting-edge technology to instantly transform your smartphone into a virtual smart car key - giving you remote lock/unlock, live diagnostics, and sharing access from anywhere.<br><br>\u2022 Wirelessly LOCK and UNLOCK your doors from anywhere. No hardware required - just your phone. Forget your keys in the car? Remote unlock will save the day.<br><br>\u2022 Monitor your car&#39;s status EVEN BEFORE you get in. Live diagnostics show tire pressure, battery/oil levels, and alert you to any potential issues, keeping your drive worry-free.<br><br>\u2022 EASILY SHARE your digital car key with family, renters, and friends - securely and at the push of a button. No more swapping physical key fobs.<br><br>\u2022 Use integrated SMART NAVIGATION to remotely locate your parked car or find the fastest route to garages and gas/charging stations.<br><br>\u2022 Compatible with OVER 20 MAJOR CAR BRANDS including Audi, BMW, Buick, Cadillac, Chevrolet, Chrysler, Dodge, Ford, GMC, Hyundai, Jaguar, Jeep, Land Rover, Lexus, Lincoln, Nissan, RAM, Tesla, Toyota, Volkswagen.<br><br>With Car Key Connect: My Car Remote, total smart car control is now in the palm of your hand. Download our app today and say goodbye to physical keys forever!",
    "summary": "Monitor cars' health on the go. Remote Connect For BMW, Mercedes, GMC, Toyota",
